                                "sense_id": "edeefede-e066-3557-ba84-8a83893e8c57",
                                "text": "Не надо быть таким бессердечным!"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "dbfa06d3-95f7-4cb0-b91b-2eb77d62b01d",
                        "source_entry_id": "8e11341d-b2ce-3723-99e5-afbc1c31936f",
                        "source_sense_id": "edeefede-e066-3557-ba84-8a83893e8c57",
                        "target_lang_word": "heartless",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "heartless",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7efb5cdf-f432-37c5-af4c-bd6839442296",
                                        "entry_id": "4e9e7f36-4cce-3791-a382-b62328c01af0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Without feeling, emotion, or concern for others; uncaring; cruel."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "04470f3c-416e-47bb-9f47-fc67a76c8956",
                                                "sense_id": "7efb5cdf-f432-37c5-af4c-bd6839442296",
                                                "text": "His heartless actions and cold manner left her saddened and feeling alone."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c9474884-b764-4116-9122-1762d8a83e97",
                                                "sense_id": "7efb5cdf-f432-37c5-af4c-bd6839442296",
                                                "text": "The world is a dangerous, violent place […] and the only true refuge from this heartless world is the family."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e2d6331d-9c7d-478a-b21f-796eeca4ffbb",
                                                "sense_id": "7efb5cdf-f432-37c5-af4c-bd6839442296",
                                                "text": "It's safer to be heartless than mindless. The history of the world is the history of the triumph of the heartless over the mindless."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7df848d9-85ca-4b57-99f8-998f487af970",
                                                "sense_id": "7efb5cdf-f432-37c5-af4c-bd6839442296",
                                                "text": "Mr. Burns is similarly perfectly cast as a heartless capitalist willing to do anything for a quick buck, even if it means endangering the lives of those around him and Marge elegantly rounds out the main cast as a good, pure-hearted and overly indulgent woman who sees the big, good heart (literally and metaphorically) of a monstrous man-brute."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7c6d48e3-f62c-3d6c-9ffc-ca14ac20aabd",
                                        "entry_id": "4e9e7f36-4cce-3791-a382-b62328c01af0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Without a physical heart."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a48b5566-1834-3ab8-a951-c1bf57455921",
                                        "entry_id": "4e9e7f36-4cce-3791-a382-b62328c01af0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Listless, unenthusiastic."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "014e7ada-b24f-4251-9545-0300018964fa",
                                                "sense_id": "a48b5566-1834-3ab8-a951-c1bf57455921",
                                                "text": "Near-synonyms: spiritless, unhearty"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "36ff8ba9-9164-37c5-b120-41e88a25d002",
                                        "entry_id": "4e9e7f36-4cce-3791-a382-b62328c01af0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Without courage; fearful, cowardly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0cccba9a-8f1f-449e-a0a7-2886124832e6",
                                                "sense_id": "36ff8ba9-9164-37c5-b120-41e88a25d002",
                                                "text": "Cecilia then, though almost heartless, resolved upon talking with Mr. Harrel himself […]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
